Description:
    Generates multitenancy for the app: an Account model, Current.account, an
    AccountScoping model concern, a Tenanting controller concern, account URL
    prefixes (/123/projects), and account propagation to jobs, mailers, and the
    console.

    Run the authentication generator first to also get memberships between users
    and accounts, and an account picker.

    Accounts come from a URL prefix by default. Pass --account-from=domain to serve
    each account from its own subdomain (acme.example.com) or custom domain, or
    --account-from=cookie to keep the current account in a signed cookie, where
    controllers choose it with switch_to_account(account).

Example:
    bin/rails generate authentication
    bin/rails generate tenanting
    bin/rails db:migrate

    bin/rails generate tenanting --account-from=domain
    bin/rails generate tenanting --account-from=cookie

Then scope models to an account:

class Project < ApplicationRecord
  scoped_to_account
end

class Task < ApplicationRecord
  belongs_to :project
  scoped_to_account through: :project
end
